        "read": true,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>Bolstering Team-Up lets Beacon take an action. &nbsp;The action chosen will follow all normal rules.</p><p>Overwhelm says to select an action, not use it. &nbsp;Each Proletariat takes that action. &nbsp;You are not using the selected action, Overwhelm is giving you the effect of that action for each Proletariat.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>That is the difference.</p>",
